<title>USA: Computer Sciences acquires Kalchas Ltd.</title>
<headline>Computer Sciences acquires Kalchas Ltd.</headline>
<dateline>EL SEGUNDO, Calif. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computer Sciences Corp Wednesday said it has acquired Kalchas Ltd, a strategic consultant firm with offices in London and New York, and it will merge the group with CSC Index, Computer Sciences management consulting unit.</p>
<p>Financial details were undisclosed.</p>
<p>&quot;The acquisition of Kalchas will double the size of our United Kingdom operations,&quot; Douglas Gray, CSC Index chief executive, said in a statement.</p>
<p>Kalchas was founded in 1988, has a staff of about 70, and serves clients around the world. It has a 15-person New York office.</p>
